### Prior art

Raven's Stellar repository index surfaced [SocketFi's Soroban smart account](https://github.com/Socket-Fi/socketfi-smart-account)
and [Crossmint's Stellar smart account](https://github.com/Crossmint/stellar-smart-account)
on 2026-10-25. SocketFi (source scan 2026-09-16, Soroban SDK `=25.3.1`) has
signer and auth-context handling with session policies. This is adjacent prior
art, not an implementation of this POC's exact contract-and-function allowlist,
and neither repository has been audited as part of this project.
